  <trk>
    <name>Eggishorn via ferrata</name>
    <desc>Exciting traverses, vertical passages, magnificent viewpoints. The Eggishorn via ferrata is a unique experience that requires surefootedness, a head for heights, and good fitness, but can also be managed by less experienced via ferrata climbers.</desc>
